</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0004h-s " data-id="e0004h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0004i-s " data-id="e0004i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004i">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0004j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004j">02</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0004k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004k">minutes 4–9</p>
		
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004l" class="e-1g6vd5e-e0004l-s e-heading-base">Check the two flags we raise</h3>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0004m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004m">A starter with no P45. Someone who crossed the auto-enrolment threshold this month. We do not bury them in a report; they are the only two things on the screen.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0004n-s " data-id="e0004n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0004o-s " data-id="e0004o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004o">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0004p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004p">03</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0004q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004q">minutes 9–11</p>
		
</div>
			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004r" class="e-1g6vd5e-e0004r-s e-heading-base">Press run</h3>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0004s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004s">Payslips go out, the pension file goes to your provider, and the RTI submission goes to HMRC before you have closed the tab.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0004t-s " data-id="e0004t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004t">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0004u-s " data-id="e0004u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004u">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004v e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1g6vd5e-e0004v-s " data-id="e0004v" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0004v">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0004w-s " data-id="e0004w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004w">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0004x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004x">Compliance</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0004y" class="e-1g6vd5e-e0004y-s e-heading-base">Pension, RTI and year-end, handled.</h2>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0004z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004z">These are the three things that turn a twenty-minute job into a Saturday. They are not modules here. They are the product.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00050 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e00050-s " data-id="e00050" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00050">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00051 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1g6vd5e-e00051-s " data-id="e00051" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00051">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00052 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e00052-s " data-id="e00052" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00052">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00053-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00053">Pension</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00054" class="e-1g6vd5e-e00054-s e-heading-base">Auto-enrolment on the clock</h3>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00055-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00055">Every employee assessed each pay period, postponement handled, contributions calculated, the file sent to Nest, Smart, The People’s Pension or your provider. Re-enrolment is diarised three years out and we tell you before it lands.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00056 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e00056-s " data-id="e00056" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00056">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00057-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00057">RTI</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00058" class="e-1g6vd5e-e00058-s e-heading-base">Filed on or before payday</h3>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00059-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00059">The FPS goes on the day you run, not the day someone remembers. EPS for statutory recoveries and the employment allowance goes when it is due, and you get the HMRC receipt reference in writing every time.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0005a-s " data-id="e0005a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005a">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0005b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005b">Year-end</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005c" class="e-1g6vd5e-e0005c-s e-heading-base">April without the invoice</h3>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0005d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005d">Final submission, P60s to every employee, new tax codes applied from the P9 notices, thresholds rolled forward. It is one email telling you it is done, and it costs the same £29 as March.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0005e-s " data-id="e0005e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0005f-s " data-id="e0005f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005g e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1g6vd5e-e0005g-s " data-id="e0005g" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0005h-s " data-id="e0005h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005h">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0005i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005i">Switching</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0005j" class="e-1g6vd5e-e0005j-s e-heading-base">Switch mid-year without breaking your figures.</h2>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0005k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005k">Bring your year-to-date figures from any provider mid-year. We reconcile them against your last FPS and tell you if they do not add up before you commit.</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0005l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005l">You do not have to wait for April, and you do not have to run two systems in parallel for a quarter to feel safe. If the reconciliation fails, we tell you which employee and which figure, and nothing moves until you say so.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0005m-s " data-id="e0005m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005m">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0005n-s " data-id="e0005n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005n">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0005o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005o">Reconciliation, 18 employees</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0005p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005p">vs last FPS</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0005q-s " data-id="e0005q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005q">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0005r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005r">Gross pay to date</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0005s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005s">matches</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0005t-s " data-id="e0005t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005t">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0005u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005u">PAYE income tax to date</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0005v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005v">matches</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0005w-s " data-id="e0005w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005w">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0005x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005x">Employee NI to date</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0005y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005y">matches</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0005z-s " data-id="e0005z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005z">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00060-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00060">Employer NI to date</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00061-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00061">matches</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00062 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e00062-s " data-id="e00062" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00062">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00063-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00063">Pension contributions, 1 employee</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00064-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00064">£18.40 out</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00065 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e00065-s " data-id="e00065" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00065">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00066-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00066">Student loan deductions</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00067-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00067">matches</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00068-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00068">One line disagrees. We show you which person, which period and which figure, before your first Plainroll run, not after it.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00069 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e00069-s " data-id="e00069" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00069">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0006a-s " data-id="e0006a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006a">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006b e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1g6vd5e-e0006b-s " data-id="e0006b" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0006b">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0006c-s " data-id="e0006c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006c">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0006d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006d">If HMRC writes to you</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0006e" class="e-1g6vd5e-e0006e-s e-heading-base">We deal with it, and we pay any penalty that was our error.</h2>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0006f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006f">If HMRC writes to you about a submission we made, we deal with it and we pay any penalty that was our error. That is in the terms, not just the marketing.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0006g-s " data-id="e0006g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0006h-s " data-id="e0006h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006h">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0006i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006i">Forward the letter</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0006j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006j">One email to the team that filed it. You are not opening a ticket and you are not explaining PAYE to a first-line agent.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0006k-s " data-id="e0006k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006k">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0006l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006l">Support, in writing</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0006m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006m">Support is email and phone, 8am to 6pm, answered by four people in Manchester who have all run payroll for a living.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0006n-s " data-id="e0006n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0006o-s " data-id="e0006o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006p e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1g6vd5e-e0006p-s " data-id="e0006p" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0006p">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0006q-s " data-id="e0006q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006q">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0006r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006r">Your accountant</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0006s" class="e-1g6vd5e-e0006s-s e-heading-base">Accountant access, free forever.</h2>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0006t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006t">Their own login, their own permissions, journals in the format they already use, and the year-end pack without a single forwarded PDF. We do not charge them for it, we do not charge you for it, and we do not use it as the reason you need the next tier up.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0006u-s " data-id="e0006u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006u">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0006v-s " data-id="e0006v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006v">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0006w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006w">Seats</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0006x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006x">Unlimited</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e0006y-s " data-id="e0006y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006y">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0006z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006z">Export</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00070-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00070">CSV and Xero</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00071 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e00071-s " data-id="e00071" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00071">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00072-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00072">Price</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00073-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00073">£0</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00074 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e00074-s " data-id="e00074" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00074">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00075-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00075">£0</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00076-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00076">The accountant seat line on our ledger, and the one line on theirs that is also free — which tells you where the rest of their pricing is hiding.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00077 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e00077-s " data-id="e00077" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00077" id="start">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00078 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1g6vd5e-e00078-s " data-id="e00078" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00078">
    			<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e00079-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00079">£29 a month, up to 50 employees</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0007a" class="e-1g6vd5e-e0007a-s e-heading-base">Run your first payroll free.</h2>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0007b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007b">Bring your figures, run one payroll on us, and check every number against what you were going to file anyway. If it does not add up, you have lost an afternoon and nothing else.</p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0007c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007c"><a href="#start" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Run your first payroll free
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-1g6vd5e-e0007d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007d">Plainroll · flat-fee payroll for UK businesses · support 8am–6pm, Manchester</p>
		
</div>

</section>

</div>
